3D Surgical Anatomy Atlas — attribution notice

EDUCATIONAL USE ONLY. Not a medical device. Not patient-specific. Not for
diagnosis, operative planning or navigation. Craniotomy footprints and entry
points are schematic approximations.

Derived 3D models in this repository are built from:

