- BodyParts3D, (c) The Database Center for Life Science (DBCLS). CC BY-SA.
- SPL-PNL Brain Atlas, Surgical Planning Laboratory & Psychiatry Neuroimaging
  Laboratory, Brigham and Women's Hospital / Harvard Medical School.
  3D Slicer licence. Cite:
  https://www.spl.harvard.edu/publications/item/view/1265
- SPL Head and Neck Atlas, Marianna Jakab & Ron Kikinis (SPL). 3D Slicer
  licence, part B. Underlying CT: MANIX dataset, OsiriX DICOM library.
- HCPex (Huang et al.), based on the HCP-MMP1 parcellation (Glasser et al.,
